       "Add a Class column (Mammalia/Aves/Actinopterygii/Amphibia/Reptilia) to Leaf_swab_taxa_ecological_traits.xlsx ",
       "and rerun. No taxonomic identities have been guessed.")
}
# Normalize known vertebrate class names; do not silently collapse other classes.
